{"id":"ponemnogu","lemma":"понемногу","pos":"adv","rank":4254,"glosses":["bit by bit, little by little (small amount at a time)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a7/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B3%D1%83.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B3%D1%83.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Он понемногу поправляется.","en":"He is getting better bit by bit.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,null]},{"text":"У нас есть всего понемногу.","en":"We have a bit of everything.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"us","l":"мы"},{"g":"there is / to eat"},{"g":"in total, in all"},null]},{"text":"Её здоровье понемногу улучшается.","en":"Her health is improving little by little.","words":[{"g":"her"},{"g":"health"},null,null]},{"text":"Мне понемногу становится лучше.","en":"I'm slowly getting better.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"to stand","l":"становиться"},{"g":"rather, would better )"}]},{"text":"Том работает изредка и понемногу.","en":"Tom works for short spells now and then.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to work","l":"работать"},{"g":"rarely, seldom"},{"g":"and"},null]}]}